lavender: fit the iPhone X canvas to the panel; touch diagnostics

- SweetFramebuffer copy path: the 1125x2436 canvas is scaled (nearest pixel, 0.96) onto the
  1080x2340 panel instead of cropping 22/48 pixels at each edge (the home indicator was cut off)
- SweetHID: touch maps panel pixels to the whole canvas the same way
- boot-arg sweetfb_fit=0 restores the crop
- sweet_touch.c: boot-arg sweettouchdiag=N logs the first N reports (default 40), then every 200th
- made by xnu/src/mk_fit.py

